 "//": "Story Phase 9 in the lower-hull barracks. The morning after the Grand Nap: grey light through the hull; the main cast up (Pete on his rope pillow, Jim at his pantry; Bob, Gristle and Ned in their beds), the Grand Stenchmaster asleep over the captain's bunk until woken. The lecture on his rug before the Mark II (11,12), the crew sitting round (the minor crew catch up on sleep in their hammocks: the floor stays clear). The board by the barrels (5,10): the org chart, then the Crimson Chart for the council, then Pete's plan. The gap in the hull planks by the stairs (6,3), where Ned sees land. From chapter 62 the landing party is gone (on deck, then ashore).",
